---
description: Keep product copy fun, short, and free of jargon
globs: "**/*.{erb,html,md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not put backend terms on screens people use. No recording, recordable, actor, or root.

Follow `recording-studio-text`. Labels are short, fun, and obvious. Use a tooltip only when a newcomer would not get the visible text.

No AI-speak. Do not fill the screen.
